nodes:
- _type: Monitor
  name: GenAI Application Metric Stream Active
  identifier: urn:stackpack:suse-ai:monitor:genai-metric-stream-active
  description: >-
    Detects a GenAI metric stream that has stopped reporting for five minutes.
    A periodically exported, unchanged operation counter is healthy even when
    the application is idle. The result expires with the 15-minute lookback.
  intervalSeconds: 60
  status: ENABLED
  function: urn:stackpack:common:monitor-function:threshold
  arguments:
    threshold: 300.0
    comparator: GT
    failureState: DEVIATING
    metric:
      aliasTemplate: Age of last GenAI metric sample
      query: >-
        time() - (max by (service_namespace, service_name)
        (max_over_time(timestamp(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_seconds_count{service_namespace!="", service_name!="", suse_ai_managed!="false"})[15m:15s])) > time() - 900)
      unit: s
    titleTemplate: GenAI metric stream freshness
    urnTemplate: urn:opentelemetry:namespace/${service_namespace}:service/${service_name}
  remediationHint: >-
    Check the application's metric exporter, Collector receiver and export
    errors. Idle applications should continue exporting cumulative counters.
    This monitor requires at least one observed GenAI operation; it cannot
    discover an application that has never emitted telemetry.
